<p style="text-align: left;">Another painting destined to be entered into the Fine Art Professionals of Norther Virginia show at Delaplaine Art Center, Frederick, MD in April. &nbsp;I completed this painting about 18 months ago and, while it is one of my favorites, I've only recently found a frame that seems to do it justice. &nbsp;I'm excited to have this one in the show.&nbsp;</p>